# Convex cube mesh (8 vertices, 12 triangles) authored for G10@P5 M1 mesh-multicontact fixtures.
# Used as the static "mesh" side for mesh-box / mesh-cylinder multicontact cases.
# MuJoCo computes the convex hull and its polygon data (mesh_poly*) from this mesh; the
# upstream convex CCD multicontact path requires mesh_polyadr >= 0 for mesh geoms.
v -0.1 -0.1 -0.1
v 0.1 -0.1 -0.1
v 0.1 0.1 -0.1
v -0.1 0.1 -0.1
v -0.1 -0.1 0.1
v 0.1 -0.1 0.1
v 0.1 0.1 0.1
v -0.1 0.1 0.1
f 1 3 2
f 1 4 3
f 5 6 7
f 5 7 8
f 1 2 6
f 1 6 5
f 2 3 7
f 2 7 6
f 3 4 8
f 3 8 7
f 4 1 5
f 4 5 8
